    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17483" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὔξ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>growth, increase,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἐχθρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.69
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>TG</u>
				13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὸ ποσόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1069b11
				</span></i>
			; of the Delta, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.13
			</span></i>: in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
			</span></i>, <i>increments,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				546b
			</span></i>; <i>multiplications,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ascl.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				2.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>amplification,</i> in Rhet., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1368a27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1413b34
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετ᾽ αὐξήσεως ἐξαγγέλλειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					10.27.8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Th.</u>
				19
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Gramm.,
				<i>the augment,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				EM
				338.47
			</span></i>.</div>
